# **Everything, and then one directory back.** The image needs exactly what `installDist` produced,
# and the repository around it is a Compose app, 102 screenshot baselines, a static site and a Gradle
# cache — a build context of hundreds of megabytes that would be uploaded to the daemon on every
# deploy and then ignored.
#
# Written as deny-all-then-allow rather than as a list of what to skip, deliberately: a list gets one
# entry behind the tree the first time somebody adds a directory, and the failure is silent and slow
# rather than loud.
*
!server/build/install/server
